    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-17107",
      "publishedDate": "2026-07-24T18:56:05.194Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-07-27T22:41:14.800Z",
      "description": "A flaw was found in the cluster-proxy service-proxy component used in Red Hat Advanced Cluster Management for Kubernetes (RHACM) and multicluster-engine (MCE). The service-proxy appends impersonation group headers to proxied requests without first removing caller-supplied values, and the spoke ServiceAccount holds unrestricted impersonation permissions. An authenticated hub principal can inject an Impersonate-Group header to escalate to cluster-admin on every managed cluster.",
      "severity": 8.5,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Red Hat multicluster engine for Kubernetes 2.10\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:46885",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-17107",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2506771",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
      "affected": [
        {
          "vendor": "Red Hat",
          "product": "multicluster engine for Kubernetes 2.10",
          "collectionURL": "https://catalog.redhat.com/software/containers/",
